-          "english": "Faced with the unstoppable advance of the revolutionary forces, Díaz asked for his departure from power to be negotiated."
+          "spanish": "El plan decía que las elecciones habían sido un fraude.",
+          "english": "The plan said that the elections had been a fraud."
         },
         {
-          "spanish": "El propio Madero pronto exigiría de sus antiguos aliados algo que muchos de ellos no estaban dispuestos a aceptar: paciencia.",
-          "english": "Madero himself would soon demand something from his former allies that many of them weren't willing to accept: patience."
