-      "content": "Unlike tanto... como (both... and, section 5 of the previous unit), no tanto... como sets up a contrast, not an equivalence -- it says the second thing is the more accurate description, not that both are equally true."
+      "content": "Use *ser* in the preterite (*fue*, *fueron*) for a completed event. Make the participle agree: *el petróleo fue expropiado*, *las tierras fueron repartidas*. Add *por* + the person only when you want to name who acted: *fundado por Calles*."
